comments.body:
Looks like we are not pinning the xtrabackup version to be the same as MySQL version:
https://github.com/vitessio/vitess/blob/main/docker/lite/install_dependencies.sh#LL104

@reporter are you able to change that file to pin xtrabackup to 8.0.30 and rebuild the image and re-test?

@participant2 pointed out that this has been fixed in the version of xtrabackup that was released yesterday
https://<redacted-host>/percona-xtrabackup/8.0/em/instant.html

> Percona XtraBackup 8.0.32-25 allows instant columns in the backup for MySQL 8.0.32. This limitation remains for backing up MySQL 8.0.31 and lower versions.
